  "description": "Your Device. Your Intelligence. Your Privacy.\n\nLocalMind AI turns your iPhone, iPad, or Mac into a powerful personal AI that runs entirely on your device with no cloud, no accounts, and no data leaving your control. \nIn a world of subscriptions and surveillance, LocalMind AI is built for independence. \nYour conversations, ideas, documents, and voice never touch a server. \nEverything stays where it belongs: on your device.\n\nA Truly Personal AI LocalMind AI isn’t just another chatbot. It’s your gateway to the open-source AI ecosystem, giving you access to a wide range of advanced models that run locally.\n\n• Choose your expert: Download and switch between leading AI models such as Llama, Qwen, Gemma, and more. \n• Match your needs: Use lightweight models for fast everyday tasks, or powerful reasoning models for coding, analysis, and deep problem-solving.\n\nWhy Choose LocalMind AI? \n• 100% Private: No cloud servers. No message history stored remotely. No tracking. Your AI lives entirely on your device. \n• Works Offline: Once a model is downloaded, you can chat, speak, and analyze documents anytime, even without an internet connection. \n• Instant Responses: By running directly on your hardware, answers feel fast and fluid with no network delay.\n\nSupercharged Capabilities \n• Natural Voice Conversations: Tap into Voice Chat Mode for hands-free, fluid voice chats. Speak naturally, interrupt anytime, and have real-time discussions with your AI without your audio ever leaving your device. \n• Private Document Analysis: Upload PDFs, TXTs, and other documents directly into the chat. Summarize long reports, extract key data, or deeply analyze texts completely offline.\n\nWhat You Can Do \n• Have lifelike voice conversations \n• Summarize and analyze private documents \n• Brainstorm ideas and write text \n• Get coding and problem-solving help \n• Chat about images and visuals \n• Journal privately and think through complex tasks\n\n...All without sending your data anywhere.\n\nKey Features\n\n• One-Tap Model Downloads: Browse and download a curated, growing collection of AI models directly inside the app. \n• Voice Chat Mode: Native, fast, on-device speech-to-text and text-to-speech. \n• Document Uploads: Securely read and query local files. \n• Clean, Focused Interface: Designed beautifully for clarity and ease of use across iPhone, iPad, and Mac.\n\nLocalMind AI is for anyone who wants the power of modern AI without giving up control.\n\nDownload LocalMind AI today and experience truly personal AI: private, offline, and right on your device.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
